# The seventh battle (stage 6, SCENE7) lost, from the save the original wrote
# after stage 5: the lance sent at the Dragon at once, ahead of the plan, meets
# its guard and loses its leader at 07:27; the defeat, the menu after it, and
# the save loaded again from it.
